From 33eea22f74accb57c3c91ec62d3b58b160206798 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chen Jun <newdays-cj@live.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:22:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] iommu: Remove unnecessary IOPF latency tracepoint export

The IOPF latency tracepoint is used within the built-in IOMMU core and
does not require an exported symbol. Keep the event definition and trace
calls while removing its GPL symbol export.

Signed-off-by: Chen Jun <newdays-cj@live.com>
---
 drivers/iommu/iommu-traces.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/iommu/iommu-traces.c b/drivers/iommu/iommu-traces.c
index ce2ab3277b5f..23416bf76df9 100644
--- a/drivers/iommu/iommu-traces.c
+++ b/drivers/iommu/iommu-traces.c
@@ -25,4 +25,3 @@ EXPORT_TRACEPOINT_SYMBOL_GPL(unmap);
 
 /* iommu_error */
 EXPORT_TRACEPOINT_SYMBOL_GPL(io_page_fault);
-EXPORT_TRACEPOINT_SYMBOL_GPL(iopf_latency);
-- 
2.43.0

